	["This shows the advanced info like what stats each aura/curse etc are adding, as well as enables the ability to edit them without a re-export\nDo not edit any boxes unless you know what you are doing, use copy/paste or import instead"] = "这会显示进阶信息，例如各光环/诅咒等加入了哪些属性，也允许不重新导出就编辑它们\n除非你知道自己在做什么，否则不要编辑任何栏位；请改用复制/粘贴或导入",
	["This socket group cannot be deleted as it is created by an equipped item."] = "此插槽组无法删除，因为它是由已装备物品创建的。",
	["This will enable the Fanaticism buff itself. (Grants 75% more cast speed, reduced skill cost, and increased area of effect)"] = "这将使【欣喜若狂】buff生效。(使得施法速度总增75%，技能消耗减少75%，效果范围提高75%)",
	["This will override the number of Mines per throw"] = "这将覆盖原本的每次投掷地雷数",
